{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00476","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 送神 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祀遵五礼，时属三秋。\n人怀肃敬，灵降祯休。\n奠歆旨酒，荐享珍羞。\n载张送乐，神其上游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}